{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_6vn73oplqpt3k6eorvlcgpfivk2pu2infsw37bwb66kdzrj33myq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01PFMsK8H2x4XUyVazgsedne","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"3KZ3B4yH0x44BL8SAdaRYB","description":"Read all text from Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];for(const id of ['0:1','1:2']){const p=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);out.push('=== '+p.name);const walk=(n,d)=>{let s='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.id+' \"'+n.name+'\" '+Math.round(n.x||0)+','+Math.round(n.y||0)+' '+Math.round(n.width||0)+'x'+Math.round(n.height||0);if(n.type==='TEXT')s+=' :: '+n.characters.replace(/\\n/g,' | ');out.push(s);if(n.children&&d<6)n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1));};p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));}return out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":971,"cache_read_input_tokens":7919,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":971,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2aad7c86-9e15-4fde-bd83-ea3ec473b32f","uuid":"77e089c1-4e95-40c8-9199-00c4499392a2","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:37:19.571Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01PFMsK8H2x4XUyVazgsedne","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01PFMsK8H2x4XUyVazgsedne","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 4:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 0,0 1440x2964\n  FRAME 4:3 \"Header\" 64,64 1312x145\n    TEXT 4:4 \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" 0,0 182x19 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT 4:5 \"Northgate Homes — real estate website\" 0,31 1312x52 :: Northgate Homes — real estate website\n    TEXT 4:6 \"Design a real estate agency website: present the agency, search and browse listings, and view one property with its details and agent contact form. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" 0,95 1312x50 :: Design a real estate agency website: present the agency, search and browse listings, and view one property with its details and agent contact form. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME 4:7 \"How to work\" 64,257 1312x249\n    TEXT 4:8 \"How to work\" 0,0 147x35 :: How to work\n    TEXT 4:9 \"1. Build exactly the 2 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo mark, the photos, the avatars, the social logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Co