on structure\" 64,1267 1312x139\n    TEXT 4:29 \"Navigation structure\" 0,0 242x35 :: Navigation structure\n    TEXT 4:30 \"• Header and footer on both frames: Logo_Mark + NORTHGATE wordmark, Buy / Sell / Rent / About, “Work with us”. No nav item is current on either frame. • Flow: 01_Home → See all listings or a listing card → 02_Property. Logo → 01_Home. • Entry only (no frame): Buy, Sell, Rent, About, Work with us, Learn more, search filters, testimonial clients, gallery thumbnails, View profile, form fields, Contact agent, similar-listing arrows, social logos, footer links.\" 0,51 1312x88 :: • Header and footer on both frames: Logo_Mark + NORTHGATE wordmark, Buy / Sell / Rent / About, “Work with us”. No nav item is current on either frame. | • Flow: 01_Home → See all listings or a listing card → 02_Property. Logo → 01_Home. | • Entry only (no frame): Buy, Sell, Rent, About, Work with us, Learn more, search filters, testimonial clients, gallery thumbnails, View profile, form fields, Contact agent, similar-listing arrows, social logos, footer links.\n  FRAME 4:31 \"Fixed data & copy\" 64,1454 1312x797\n    TEXT 4:32 \"Fixed data & copy\" 0,0 207x35 :: Fixed data & copy\n    TEXT 4:33 \"Use these values verbatim.\" 0,51 1312x22 :: Use these values verbatim.\n    FRAME 4:34 \"Data blocks\" 0,89 1312x708\n      FRAME 4:35 \"Home copy\" 0,0 420x258\n        TEXT 4:36 \"Home copy\" 20,20 78x20 :: Home copy\n        TEXT 4:37 \"Hero: Hand-picked homes, honest advice and a team that knows every street in the neighbourhoods we serve. You’re in good hands: Our agents have helped more than 2,000 families buy, sell and rent. We listen first, explain every step and stay with you until the keys are in your hand. Local experts on every street: We live where we work. From school catchments to the quietest blocks, we can tell you what the listing photos don’t. Ready to sell your home?: Get a free valuation and a clear plan to sell at the right price, on your timeline.\" 20,48 380x190 :: Hero: Hand-picked homes, honest advice and a team that knows every street in the neighbourhoods we serve. | You’re in good hands: Our agents have helped more than 2,000 families buy, sell and rent. We listen first, explain every step and stay with you until the keys are in your hand. | Local experts on every street: We live where we work. From school catchments to the quietest blocks, we can tell you what the listing photos don’t. | Ready to sell your home?: Get a free valuation and a clear plan to sell at the right price, on your timeline.\n      FRAME 4:38 \"Listings (01, in order)\" 444,0 420x220\n        TEXT 4:39 \"Listings (01, in order)\" 20,20 145x20 :: Listings (01, in order)\n        TEXT 4:40 \"Malto House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,650 sq ft (Photo_Listing_1) Birchwood Villa · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,720 sq ft (Photo_Listing_2) Cedar Lane House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,580 sq ft (Photo_Listing_3) Harbor View Loft · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,610 sq ft (Photo_Listing_4) Maple Court House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,690 sq ft (Photo_Listing_5) Willow Creek Home · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,640 sq ft (Photo_Listing_6)\" 20,48 380x152 :: Malto House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,650 sq ft (Photo_Listing_1) | Birchwood Villa · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,720 sq ft (Photo_Listing_2) | Cedar Lane House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,580 sq ft (Photo_Listing_3) | Harbor View Loft · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,610 sq ft (Photo_Listing_4) | Maple Court House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,690 sq ft (Photo_Listing_5) | Willow Creek Home · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,640 sq ft (Photo_Listing_6)\n      FRAME 4:41 \"Testimonial (01)\" 888,0 420x163\n        TEXT 4:42 \"Testimonial (01)\" 20,20 111x20 :: Testimonial (01)\n        TEXT 4:43 \"“Kayley and the team found us a home we love in under a month. They knew every street, never pushed us, and we always felt in good hands.” Clients: Leo Madrigal · Owen Brooks · Mia Chen — each “Client”, all with Avatar_Client\" 20,48 380x95 :: “Kayley and the team found us a home we love in under a month. They knew every street, never pushed us, and we always felt in good hands.” | Clients: Leo Madrigal · Owen Brooks · Mia Chen — each “Client”, all with Avatar_Client\n      FRAME 4:44 \"Modern House (02)\" 0,282 420x163\n        TEXT 4:45 \"Modern House (02)\" 20,20 134x20 :: Modern House (02)\n        TEXT 4:46 \"3002 Foster Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11210, USA · $450,000 · $280/sq ft (1,607 sq ft) Details: 4 Bedrooms · 2 Bathrooms · 2 Garage · 1 Floor · Built 2007 Agent: Kayley Hall\" 20,48 380x95 :: 3002 Foster Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11210, USA · $450,000 · $280/sq ft (1,607 sq ft) | Details: 4 Bedrooms · 2 Bathrooms · 2 Garage · 1 Floor · Built 2007 | Agent: Kayley Hall\n      FRAME 4:47 \"Description (02)\" 444,282 420x258\n        TEXT 4:48 \"Description (02)\" 20,20 113x20 :: Description (02)\n        TEXT 4:49 \"A bright, single-storey family home on a quiet tree-lined street, a short walk from Foster Avenue’s cafés and the subway. The open-plan kitchen with a large island flows into the living and dining area, with floor-to-ceiling windows onto a private garden. Four bedrooms include a main suite with its own bathroom. Built in 2007 and updated in 2022, the house has a double garage, central air conditioning, new flooring throughout and plenty of built-in storage.\" 20,48 380x190 :: A bright, single-storey family home on a quiet tree-lined street, a short walk from Foster Avenue’s cafés and the subway. | The open-plan kitchen with a large island flows into the living and dining area, with floor-to-ceiling windows onto a private garden. Four bedrooms include a main suite with its own bathroom. | Built in 2007 and updated in 2022, the house has a double garage, central air conditioning, new flooring throughout and plenty of built-in storage.\n      FRAME 4:50 \"Features (02, in order)\" 888,282 420x144\n        TEXT 4:51 \"Features (02, in order)\" 20,20 153x20 :: Features (02, in order)\n        TEXT 4:52 \"Air conditioning · Central heating · Hardwood floors · Open-plan kitchen · Kitchen island · Dishwasher · Laundry room · Walk-in closet · En-suite bathroom · Private garden · Patio · Double garage · Security system · Solar panels · Storage room\" 20,48 380x76 :: Air conditioning · Central heating · Hardwood floors · Open-plan kitchen · Kitchen island · Dishwasher · Laundry room · Walk-in closet · En-suite bathroom · Private garden · Patio · Double garage · Security system · Solar panels · Storage room\n      FRAME 4:53 \"Similar listings (02, in order)\" 0,564 420x144\n        TEXT 4:54 \"Similar listings (02, in order)\" 20,20 194x20 :: Similar listings (02, in order)\n        TEXT 4:55 \"Malto House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,650 sq ft (Photo_Listing_1) Birchwood Villa · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,720 sq ft (Photo_Listing_2) Cedar Lane House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,580 sq ft (Photo_Listing_3) Harbor View Loft · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,610 sq ft (Photo_Listing_4)\" 20,48 380x76 :: Malto House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,650 sq ft (Photo_Listing_1) | Birchwood Villa · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,720 sq ft (Photo_Listing_2) | Cedar Lane House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,580 sq ft (Photo_Listing_3) | Harbor View Loft · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,610 sq ft (Photo_Listing_4)\n      FRAME 4:56 \"Footer columns (both frames)\" 444,564 420x144\n        TEXT 4:57 \"Footer columns (both frames)\" 20,20 204x20 :: Footer columns (both frames)\n        TEXT 4:58 \"Company: About us · Our agents · Careers · Contact Services: Buy a home · Sell a home · Rent a home · Property management Resources: Market reports · Buyer guide · Seller guide · FAQ\" 20,48 380x76 :: Company: About us · Our agents · Careers · Contact | Services: Buy a home · Sell a home · Rent a home · Property management | Resources: Market reports · Buyer guide · Seller guide · FAQ\n  FRAME 4:59 \"What is fixed · what is yours\" 64,2299 1312x272\n    TEXT 4:60 \"What is fixed · what is yours\" 0,0 328x35 :: What is fixed · what is yours\n    FRAME 4:61 \"Fixed vs yours\" 0,51 1312x221\n      FRAME 4:62 \"Fixed (given)\" 0,0 644x221\n        TEXT 4:63 \"Fixed (given)\" 24,24 103x23 :: Fixed (given)\n 